WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.812 --> 00:00:02.979
- Oh, damn it.

00:00:05.526 --> 00:00:07.214
Come on man.

00:00:07.214 --> 00:00:08.899
He thinks that's happening.

00:00:08.899 --> 00:00:11.474
- I love pizza, okay, there I said it.

00:00:11.474 --> 00:00:14.529
I love pizza so much that
I'm wearing it today.

00:00:14.529 --> 00:00:16.638
As you can see, it's a
beautiful day in New York

00:00:16.638 --> 00:00:18.367
so I thought it's the perfect day

00:00:18.367 --> 00:00:21.495
to track down something
I saw on Instagram.

00:00:21.495 --> 00:00:22.734
Are you fucking kidding me?

00:00:22.734 --> 00:00:24.356
Fucking kidding me?

00:00:24.356 --> 00:00:26.243
This is what happens when the two types

00:00:26.243 --> 00:00:28.774
of food make sweet,
sweet love to each other

00:00:28.774 --> 00:00:30.016
and have a baby.

00:00:30.016 --> 00:00:32.152
Cheeseburger and pizza.

00:00:32.152 --> 00:00:33.592
And of course this pizza comes

00:00:33.592 --> 00:00:35.767
from Vinnie's in Brooklyn,
which at this point

00:00:35.767 --> 00:00:37.479
is basically pizzeria crossed

00:00:37.479 --> 00:00:39.456
with a mad scientist's laboratory.

00:00:39.456 --> 00:00:42.245
Now I wouldn't dare go
on this journey by myself

00:00:42.245 --> 00:00:44.495
so I'm gonna grab a friend.

00:00:47.593 --> 00:00:49.343
- Cheeseburger pizza.

00:00:50.514 --> 00:00:51.493
Right now?

00:00:51.493 --> 00:00:53.148
Just let me finish.

00:00:53.148 --> 00:00:55.193
Okay, just, just.

00:00:55.193 --> 00:00:56.791
- So I just knocked Jade out of her chair

00:00:56.791 --> 00:00:59.208
which is not a good look but.

00:01:03.962 --> 00:01:06.545
(upbeat music)

00:01:07.507 --> 00:01:11.186
- We are off the subway
headed over to Vinnie's.

00:01:11.186 --> 00:01:13.525
Gonna eat some pizza
with cheeseburgers on it.

00:01:13.525 --> 00:01:15.080
What the hell is that?

00:01:15.080 --> 00:01:16.190
We're about to be there soon

00:01:16.190 --> 00:01:17.807
and I have a feeling this is gonna be

00:01:17.807 --> 00:01:19.088
a shit ton of food.

00:01:19.088 --> 00:01:20.525
When's the last time you had pizza?

00:01:20.525 --> 00:01:21.771
- Last night.

00:01:21.771 --> 00:01:23.295
- I'm actually curious to see

00:01:23.295 --> 00:01:25.852
if the cheeseburger's gonna be too much.

00:01:25.852 --> 00:01:27.280
Too much topping on the pizza.

00:01:27.280 --> 00:01:30.048
I mean, I don't know if you can have just.

00:01:30.048 --> 00:01:31.242
Come on.

00:01:31.242 --> 00:01:32.668
- Come on, Chris.

00:01:32.668 --> 00:01:33.843
Keep up with me, man.

00:01:33.843 --> 00:01:35.501
Keep up.

00:01:35.501 --> 00:01:36.598
Be there in five minutes.

00:01:36.598 --> 00:01:38.933
Come on Chris, you can do it.

00:01:38.933 --> 00:01:41.209
- [Chris] There she is.

00:01:41.209 --> 00:01:42.042
- [Jade] Beauty.

00:01:42.042 --> 00:01:43.647
- Coming up on the homestretch.

00:01:43.647 --> 00:01:44.893
I see it.

00:01:44.893 --> 00:01:45.830
Where is it?

00:01:45.830 --> 00:01:47.120
Boom, right there.

00:01:47.120 --> 00:01:49.870
(dramatic music)

00:01:55.763 --> 00:01:57.214
- My name's Henrik Toncic.

00:01:57.214 --> 00:01:59.873
We're at Vinnie's Pizzeria
in Greenpoint, Brooklyn.

00:01:59.873 --> 00:02:02.035
My inspiration for the cheeseburger pizza

00:02:02.035 --> 00:02:04.795
came from music, mandalas,

00:02:04.795 --> 00:02:07.674
melting pots, and madness.

00:02:07.674 --> 00:02:10.105
Remixes and mashups.

00:02:10.105 --> 00:02:11.631
The best of both worlds.

00:02:11.631 --> 00:02:13.381
So we make a Vinnie's

00:02:14.366 --> 00:02:17.183
original large cheese pizza.

00:02:17.183 --> 00:02:19.556
We grill up the burgers, put the burgers

00:02:19.556 --> 00:02:22.024
and the American cheese on the pie

00:02:22.024 --> 00:02:23.327
right when it comes out,

00:02:23.327 --> 00:02:27.008
pop that back in the
oven, let the cheese melt,

00:02:27.008 --> 00:02:30.125
then when it comes out
top it with the bun,

00:02:30.125 --> 00:02:32.138
and then add the garnishes which are

00:02:32.138 --> 00:02:35.515
ketchup, mustard, white onions,

00:02:35.515 --> 00:02:36.515
and pickles.

00:02:38.050 --> 00:02:39.467
Here you go guys.

00:02:42.346 --> 00:02:44.350
- You ever play spin the pizza?

00:02:44.350 --> 00:02:45.452
I don't want to eat it.

00:02:45.452 --> 00:02:48.482
He took so much time and
effort to make this so pretty.

00:02:48.482 --> 00:02:51.111
Look at how perfect that
just pops out of there.

00:02:51.111 --> 00:02:54.262
- I will say this has some weight to it.

00:02:54.262 --> 00:02:55.182
- Cheers.
- Cheers.

00:02:55.182 --> 00:02:56.265
- Here we go.

00:02:58.956 --> 00:03:00.705
Let me tell you something.

00:03:00.705 --> 00:03:01.699
Let me tell you something.

00:03:01.699 --> 00:03:03.371
I don't even know what's happening.

00:03:03.371 --> 00:03:06.825
My brain cannot process this food.

00:03:06.825 --> 00:03:08.031
- That first bite of a pickle

00:03:08.031 --> 00:03:10.931
it just makes you so excited
to eat the rest of this.

00:03:10.931 --> 00:03:13.709
- I will say I'm about
halfway through one slice

00:03:13.709 --> 00:03:15.761
in the midst of the meat.

00:03:15.761 --> 00:03:16.916
Staring to sweat.

00:03:16.916 --> 00:03:20.062
This doesn't work if it's not good pizza.

00:03:20.062 --> 00:03:21.213
And it is.

00:03:21.213 --> 00:03:22.100
- Great pizza.

00:03:22.100 --> 00:03:25.414
- I am so pleasantly surprised by this.

00:03:25.414 --> 00:03:27.997
(upbeat music)

00:03:29.828 --> 00:03:31.682
Jade, come on.

00:03:31.682 --> 00:03:32.780
Do not give up on me right now.

00:03:32.780 --> 00:03:34.497
- Halftime guys, halftime.
- It's not halftime.

00:03:34.497 --> 00:03:35.788
- This is what happens behind the scenes

00:03:35.788 --> 00:03:37.538
of Chris's Instagram.

00:03:40.351 --> 00:03:42.643
- Here we are just having
the last bite of a slice.

00:03:42.643 --> 00:03:44.476
I look up and Jade is.

00:03:47.397 --> 00:03:49.905
Even though the slice is
presented a certain way,

00:03:49.905 --> 00:03:51.307
you can kind of take it apart.

00:03:51.307 --> 00:03:52.672
You're like, oh, I don't want onions here,

00:03:52.672 --> 00:03:54.462
I'd rather have the pickle on this bite.

00:03:54.462 --> 00:03:56.122
To anyone who called Jade a quitter,

00:03:56.122 --> 00:03:58.455
better take your words back.

00:04:05.061 --> 00:04:07.392
I kind of feel like
that's all we got in us.

00:04:07.392 --> 00:04:09.975
We came, we fought pretty hard.

00:04:11.344 --> 00:04:13.224
Jade's asleep.

00:04:13.224 --> 00:04:14.057
- Okay.

00:04:17.203 --> 00:04:19.272
- We just left Vinnie's.

00:04:19.272 --> 00:04:21.872
We got our to go box here.

00:04:21.872 --> 00:04:23.818
- It was a little intimidating
when I first got it.

00:04:23.818 --> 00:04:25.000
That thing is just like.

00:04:25.000 --> 00:04:27.938
It definitely takes a lot of stomach room.

00:04:27.938 --> 00:04:29.452
- Like you said, you go in hungry

00:04:29.452 --> 00:04:30.982
and you think you're
gonna eat a lot of it.

00:04:30.982 --> 00:04:34.036
You get one slice in on that guy,

00:04:34.036 --> 00:04:35.536
you're going down.

